        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-09">October 9, 2026</time></span>
        <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-8-zip-up-hoodie-manufacturers-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">A zip up hoodie reads simple on a spec sheet. On the floor, it is one of the least forgiving garments in knitwear. The zipper teeth have to meet at the chin without a step, the placket has to lie flat after a wash cycle, and 2x2 rib at the cuffs and hem has to recover its shape after a season of wear. Buyers who treat hoodies as a commodity purchase usually pay for it twice: a second sample round, then a late shipment.</p>
