        <p>Two things to state plainly before the list. This is not a 1-to-8 quality ranking; the order reflects sourcing scenario. And YAUUM appears here because we manufacture zip up hoodies, labeled as our own entry rather than dressed up as a neutral pick. Every name below is a starting point for your own vetting, ours included.</p>
